# Staunton Water Gun

## Installation

* Mounting
  mjpg stream
* Calibration
* Control
curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arduino/arduino-cli/master/install.sh | BINDIR=~/local/bin sh
```
git clone https://github.com/stauntonmakerspace/WaterGun
cd WaterGun/
pip install -e .
```

